---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/landing/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/landing/Footer.astro';

const title = "SPEC";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="fixed inset-0 noise-bg pointer-events-none z-50"></div>
  <div class="fixed top-[-10%] right-[-5%] w-[600px] h-[600px] gradient-sphere pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
  
  <Navbar />
  <main class="relative pt-32 max-w-[1600px] mx-auto px-8 min-h-screen">
    
<!-- Section 1: Header -->
<header class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end border-b border-outline-variant/20 pb-8">
<div class="space-y-2">
<div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-primary font-mono text-sm tracking-widest uppercase">
<span class="w-2 h-2 bg-primary rounded-full animate-pulse"></span>
<span>System Online // Internal Use Only</span>
</div>
<h1 class="font-headline text-6xl font-bold tracking-tighter uppercase leading-none">
                    SPECIFICATION <span class="text-outline-variant tracking-normal font-light">//</span> SHEET
                </h1>
</div>
<div class="text-right font-mono text-xs space-y-1 text-on-surface-variant uppercase">
<p>Build: <span class="text-on-surface">v4.2.0-STABLE</span></p>
<p>Last Sync: <span class="text-on-surface">2024.05.12 // 04:02:11 UTC</span></p>
<p>Kernel: <span class="text-on-surface">6.12.0-tajs-pro</span></p>
</div>
</header>
<!-- Section 2: Core Architecture Bento Grid -->
<section class="space-y-6">
<div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
<span class="font-headline text-lg font-bold tracking-widest text-primary uppercase">01. Core Architecture</span>
<div class="h-px flex-grow bg-outline-variant/20"></div>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-1">
<!-- Processor Unit -->
<div class="lg:col-span-5 glass-panel p-8 rounded-xl glow-subtle relative overflow-hidden group">
<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 font-mono text-[10px] text-primary/20 group-hover:text-primary/40 transition-colors">ARCH_ID: NEURAL_X</div>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mb-6 block text-4xl" data-icon="memory">memory</span>
<h3 class="font-headline text-3xl font-bold mb-2">256x Neural-X Cores</h3>
<p class="font-body text-on-surface-variant text-sm mb-6 max-w-xs">Massively parallel synaptic processing units optimized for real-time inference and recursive neural tasking.</p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-6 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-mono text-xs">
<div>
<span class="block text-on-surface-variant mb-1">Clock Speed</span>
<span class="text-primary">8.4 GHz Burst</span>
</div>
<div>
<span class="block text-on-surface-variant mb-1">L3 Cache</span>
<span class="text-primary">2.5 GB Synaptic</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Memory Block -->
<div class="lg:col-span-3 glass-panel p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-high/40">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mb-6 block text-4xl" data-icon="developer_board">developer_board</span>
<h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold mb-1">128GB LPDDR6X</h3>
<p class="font-mono text-xs text-secondary/80 mb-6 uppercase">Minimum Validated</p>
<div class="space-y-3">
<div class="h-1 bg-surface-container-highest rounded-full overflow-hidden">
<div class="h-full bg-secondary w-3/4"></div>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between font-mono text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">
<span>ECC ENABLED</span>
<span>98.4 GB/S BUS</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Throughput Module -->
<div class="lg:col-span-4 glass-panel p-8 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-6">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-4xl" data-icon="speed">speed</span>
<span class="px-2 py-1 bg-primary/10 text-primary font-mono text-[10px] rounded uppercase tracking-tighter">Peak Bandwidth</span>
</div>
<div class="font-headline text-5xl font-black text-on-surface mb-2">400 <span class="text-2xl font-medium text-on-surface-variant">TB/S</span></div>
<p class="font-body text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Internal data fabric throughput utilizing photonic interconnects.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-outline-variant/10 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-xs">
<span class="text-primary">FABRIC_OS_V4</span>
<span class="text-on-surface-variant">Latency: 0.002ms</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Section 3: Module Specs -->
<section class="space-y-6">
<div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
<span class="font-headline text-lg font-bold tracking-widest text-primary uppercase">02. Module Breakdown</span>
<div class="h-px flex-grow bg-outline-variant/20"></div>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
<!-- Neural Sync -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-low p-1 rounded-xl group transition-all duration-500 hover:bg-primary/20">
<div class="bg-surface p-6 rounded-lg h-full space-y-6">
<div class="flex justify-between items-center">
<h4 class="font-headline font-bold text-lg uppercase tracking-tight">Neural Sync</h4>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" data-icon="sync_alt">sync_alt</span>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4 font-mono text-xs">
<div class="flex justify-between border-b border-outline-variant/10 pb-2">
<span class="text-on-surface-variant">Sync Latency</span>
<span class="text-on-surface">0.04 ms</span>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between border-b border-outline-variant/10 pb-2">
<span class="text-on-surface-variant">Buffer Size</span>
<span class="text-on-surface">16 GB Overflow</span>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between border-b border-outline-variant/10 pb-2">
<span class="text-on-surface-variant">Encryption</span>
<span class="text-on-surface">AES-4096-Q</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-3 bg-surface-container-low rounded border-l-2 border-primary italic font-body text-xs text-on-surface-variant">
                            "Real-time cross-module state reconciliation."
                        </div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Pattern Recognition -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-low p-1 rounded-xl group transition-all duration-500 hover:bg-secondary/20">
<div class="bg-surface p-6 rounded-lg h-full space-y-6">
<div class="flex justify-between items-center">
<h4 class="font-headline font-bold text-lg uppercase tracking-tight">Pattern Recognition</h4>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary" data-icon="visibility">visibility</span>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4 font-mono text-xs">
<div class="flex justify-between border-b border-outline-variant/10 pb-2">
<span class="text-on-surface-variant">Confidence Floor</span>
<span class="text-on-surface">99.98%</span>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between border-b border-outline-variant/10 pb-2">
<span class="text-on-surface-variant">Sample Rate</span>
<span class="text-on-surface">1.2 GHz</span>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between border-b border-outline-variant/10 pb-2">
<span class="text-on-surface-variant">Vector Dim</span>
<span class="text-on-surface">32,768-D</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-3 bg-surface-container-low rounded border-l-2 border-secondary italic font-body text-xs text-on-surface-variant">
                            "High-fidelity heuristic analysis engine."
                        </div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Focus Engine -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-low p-1 rounded-xl group transition-all duration-500 hover:bg-tertiary/20">
<div class="bg-surface p-6 rounded-lg h-full space-y-6">
<div class="flex justify-between items-center">
<h4 class="font-headline font-bold text-lg uppercase tracking-tight">Focus Engine</h4>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary" data-icon="center_focus_strong">center_focus_strong</span>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4 font-mono text-xs">
<div class="flex justify-between border-b border-outline-variant/10 pb-2">
<span class="text-on-surface-variant">Thread Priority</span>
<span class="text-on-surface">REAL_TIME_0</span>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between border-b border-outline-variant/10 pb-2">
<span class="text-on-surface-variant">Isolation Level</span>
<span class="text-on-surface">KERNEL_L4</span>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between border-b border-outline-variant/10 pb-2">
<span class="text-on-surface-variant">Resource Lock</span>
<span class="text-on-surface">DEDICATED</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-3 bg-surface-container-low rounded border-l-2 border-tertiary italic font-body text-xs text-on-surface-variant">
                            "Cognitive priority load balancing."
                        </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Section 4: System Protocols -->
<section class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
<div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6">
<div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
<span class="font-headline text-lg font-bold tracking-widest text-primary uppercase">03. Active Protocols</span>
<div class="h-px flex-grow bg-outline-variant/20"></div>
</div>
<div class="overflow-hidden glass-panel rounded-xl">
<table class="w-full text-left font-mono text-xs">
<thead>
<tr class="bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-tighter">
<th class="px-6 py-4 font-medium">Protocol ID</th>
<th class="px-6 py-4 font-medium">Alias</th>
<th class="px-6 py-4 font-medium">Hex Address</th>
<th class="px-6 py-4 font-medium">Security Status</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="divide-y divide-outline-variant/10">
<tr class="hover:bg-primary/5 transition-colors">
<td class="px-6 py-4 text-on-surface">P_001_NIP</td>
<td class="px-6 py-4 text-on-surface-variant">Neural Interface</td>
<td class="px-6 py-4 text-primary">0xBF42_A1</td>
<td class="px-6 py-4">
<span class="flex items-center text-green-400">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-green-400 rounded-full mr-2"></span>
                                        SECURE
                                    </span>
</td>
</tr>
<tr class="hover:bg-primary/5 transition-colors">
<td class="px-6 py-4 text-on-surface">P_044_RNL</td>
<td class="px-6 py-4 text-on-surface-variant">Recursive Logic</td>
<td class="px-6 py-4 text-primary">0x992E_C9</td>
<td class="px-6 py-4">
<span class="flex items-center text-green-400">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-green-400 rounded-full mr-2"></span>
                                        SECURE
                                    </span>
</td>
</tr>
<tr class="hover:bg-primary/5 transition-colors">
<td class="px-6 py-4 text-on-surface">P_102_XDT</td>
<td class="px-6 py-4 text-on-surface-variant">X-Dimensional Transfer</td>
<td class="px-6 py-4 text-primary">0xCC01_FF</td>
<td class="px-6 py-4">
<span class="flex items-center text-primary-dim">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary-dim rounded-full mr-2"></span>
                                        ENCRYPTED
                                    </span>
</td>
</tr>
<tr class="hover:bg-primary/5 transition-colors">
<td class="px-6 py-4 text-on-surface">P_009_VLD</td>
<td class="px-6 py-4 text-on-surface-variant">Vector Layer Depth</td>
<td class="px-6 py-4 text-primary">0xA400_01</td>
<td class="px-6 py-4">
<span class="flex items-center text-green-400">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-green-400 rounded-full mr-2"></span>
                                        SECURE
                                    </span>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Technical Notes (Small Print) -->
<div class="space-y-6">
<div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
<span class="font-headline text-lg font-bold tracking-widest text-primary uppercase">04. Notes</span>
<div class="h-px flex-grow bg-outline-variant/20"></div>
</div>
<div class="p-6 bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 rounded-xl space-y-4">
<div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-dim text-sm mt-1" data-icon="info">info</span>
<p class="font-body text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
<strong class="text-on-surface block mb-1">Hardware Root of Trust</strong>
                            TajsOS implements a physical secure enclave independent of the main processing fabric. All biometric and identity tokens are stored within the Nitro-Key module, unreachable by kernel-level operations.
                        </p>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-dim text-sm mt-1" data-icon="lock_open">lock_open</span>
<p class="font-body text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
<strong class="text-on-surface block mb-1">Kernel Sandboxing</strong>
                            Modules are containerized using Tajs-Zero hypervisor. Every process exists in a strictly defined memory space with zero lateral movement capability unless explicitly defined by the Security Protocol P_000.
                        </p>
</div>
<div class="pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/10">
<img class="w-full h-16 object-cover rounded opacity-40 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700" data-alt="Abstract digital circuit pattern with purple neon lines" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAdqI43tWcv4UNZ__AAyLHV8x5szVtPpN5heOYsCRXAHw_BkvyFNMmWl7juH_rt5C-0ixKAtxZEFDDfsGRdbY2sXbF0RypZFhrYa8Oltuot2vBVZl_sInxT-NsFUZGRz7UdoSXmU-tUtFWbI-wPX0BB3o4HtOqzwAAu6OB4TsVPnaWp4OAAzDhyPn7aU_q_IUyqS9ra3N2tYF2ZlKmZs8QXGmk8uSEi_AK93Zec0SaIcN6xwyWj6bBjcyuBaGQxTozF79PyQp9XD8w"/>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
